{"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 1}, "content": [{"text": "New User Manual sections to be verified", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "This is the review queue for OpenELIS Global user-manual pages. A page lives here while it is a draft, and moves into the manual only after a reviewer has driven it on a live instance.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "panel", "attrs": {"panelType": "warning"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Rebuilt 2026-08-05. ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"text": "The previous version of this page indexed 10 draft pages from the March 2026 generation. All 10 have since been deleted, so every link in that table was dead, while the 39 drafts actually parented here were listed nowhere. The index also still instructed reviewers to verify against v3.2.1.3. Current release is ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "3.2.1.11", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"text": ".", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"text": "How to record a verdict", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Use Confluence ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "labels", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"text": ", never a title suffix. Labels are queryable, survive the rename that happens at promotion, and do not require rewriting the body.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "doc-verified", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"text": " \u2014 a reviewer drove the workflow live and it passed", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "verified-v3.2.1", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"text": " \u2014 the release verified against", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "doc-blocked", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"text": " \u2014 a step could not be reached; resolve before promotion", "type": "text"}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Add a provenance stamp to the page as well: reviewer, date, instance, release. Find everything awaiting promotion with ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "label = \"doc-verified\" AND ancestor = 1189609473 AND type = page", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"text": ". Live status comes from those labels \u2014 deliberately not from a status column on this page, which is how the last index rotted.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "rule"}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"text": "Queue \u2014 39 pages parented here", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Unless noted, every draft below was written against 3.2.1.10 or earlier and needs re-checking against 3.2.1.11.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3}, "content": [{"text": "Test Catalog Management \u2014 5 drafts \u00b7 owned by OGC-1154", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Corrections for these are already enumerated on ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "OGC-1154", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}, {"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/browse/OGC-1154"}}]}, {"text": ". Do not re-derive them here.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Test Catalog Management: the unified editor", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1432453132"}}]}, {"text": " \u2014 ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "priority", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"text": ": the live workflow overview names this page as \u201cStart here\u201d, so the published manual currently links into the review area.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Admin \u2014 Sample Type Management", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1420853278"}}]}, {"text": " \u2014 verify; drift report has this section clean.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Authoring the OpenELIS Test Catalog in CSV", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1442414603"}}]}, {"text": " \u2014 ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "duplicate", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"text": ": an older page of the same title exists at ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "1266122780", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1266122780"}}]}, {"text": " (April 2026, written against the Indonesia distro). Decide which is canonical and retire the other.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Duplicate a test", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1431633936"}}]}, {"text": " \u2014 ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "retire or rewrite", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"text": ": documents a feature that is not available. Its stated reason is also wrong for 3.2.1.11 \u2014 the button was removed, it does not merely fail to open.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Read-only & cross-link sections", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1432649742"}}]}, {"text": " \u2014 rewrite per OGC-1154.", "type": "text"}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3}, "content": [{"text": "Environmental & Vector \u2014 6 drafts \u00b7 owned by OGC-1076", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "The three domains & the shared order wizard", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1428881409"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Compliance evaluation", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1428946945"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Pooling & deconvolution", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1429012481"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Enter results & read the compliance evaluation", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1427275807"}}]}, {"text": " \u2014 drift report status ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "ok", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"text": ".", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Validate & release results", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1427439642"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Label & store samples (shared stage)", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1428684802"}}]}, {"text": " \u2014 shared with the Vector workflow; verify once, promote once.", "type": "text"}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3}, "content": [{"text": "Administrator configuration \u2014 16 drafts \u00b7 no owner yet", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Drafted 30 June 2026. These cover the admin pages the manual has never documented. None is currently in any epic.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Site Information", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1439432709"}}]}, {"text": " \u2014 highest value of this group: ~130 settings across 20 domains, and it holds the accession-prefix one-way door.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Application Properties", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1439367188"}}]}, {"text": " \u2014 ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "must state that edits here do not persist across a restart", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"text": "; the handler mutates in-memory properties only.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "User Management", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1439367205"}}]}, {"text": " \u2014 also the place to explain that a Program is invisible until users are assigned to its test section.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Reflex Testing", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1439137808"}}]}, {"text": " \u2014 must cover the grammar's limits (no nesting, no panels, no age/sex) and that there is no dry-run.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Calculated Value Tests", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1438842886"}}]}, {"text": " \u2014 must state that scope is per patient, not per order, and that Patient Weight is offered but ignored.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Program Entry", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1439006727"}}]}, {"text": " \u2014 must state that a Program cannot be retired once created.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Result Reporting Configuration", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1439596548"}}]}, {"text": " \u2014 retitle or add a disambiguating note; readers mistake this for printed-report setup.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Lab Number Management", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1439170565"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Organization Management", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1437892659"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Provider Management", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1439203334"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Dictionary Menu", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1438973976"}}]}, {"text": " \u2014 distinguish the dictionary \u201cprograms\u201d category from Program records.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Menu Configuration", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1439694850"}}]}, {"text": " \u2014 note that adding a new menu entry needs a migration; this page only toggles existing ones.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Test Notification Configuration", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1439072261"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Calendar Management", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1439334404"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Search Index Management", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1438973960"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Logging Configuration", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1438908431"}}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3}, "content": [{"text": "End-user workflows \u2014 9 drafts \u00b7 no owner yet", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Drafted 30 June \u2013 1 July 2026. Several are daily-use tasks, which makes them the highest-traffic pages in the queue.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Results Entry", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1439072277"}}]}, {"text": " \u2014 drift ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "ok", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"text": ". Should note that reflexes and calculations fire silently on save and are reported only in the post-save toast.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Validation", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1441202177"}}]}, {"text": " \u2014 drift ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "ok", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"text": ".", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Patient Management", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1441136648"}}]}, {"text": " \u2014 drift ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "ok", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"text": ".", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Register a New Patient", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1440841760"}}]}, {"text": " \u2014 drift ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "ok", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"text": ". Supersedes the older \u201cAdding a Patient\u201d draft below.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Merge Patient Records", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1440907275"}}]}, {"text": " \u2014 drift ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "ok", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"text": ".", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Order Search & Lookup", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1440350210"}}]}, {"text": " \u2014 drift ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "ok", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"text": ".", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Aliquot Management", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1440940035"}}]}, {"text": " \u2014 drift ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "ok", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"text": ".", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Sample Storage", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1440677908"}}]}, {"text": " \u2014 drift ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "ok", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"text": ".", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Running Reports", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1440841744"}}]}, {"text": " \u2014 drift ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "ok", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"text": ". Keep separate from report ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "configuration", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"text": ", which is an admin task.", "type": "text"}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3}, "content": [{"text": "Not manual drafts \u2014 re-home or retire (3)", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Adding a Patient", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1418166310"}}]}, {"text": " \u2014 ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "retire.", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"text": " 24 June draft superseded by \u201cRegister a New Patient\u201d (1 July). Two pages document the same task.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Reference Lab Results \u2014 Dev Primer (OGC-796)", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1349091330"}}]}, {"text": " \u2014 ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "re-home.", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"text": " A developer primer, not a manual page. It should not be in the manual review queue.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "User manual style guide", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1529872422"}}]}, {"text": " \u2014 ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "keep.", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"text": " Authoring guidance, parented here deliberately so it stays out of the reader-facing manual. Tracked on OGC-1154.", "type": "text"}]}]}]}, {"type": "rule"}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"text": "Structural problems found 2026-08-05", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "These are tree problems rather than content problems, and none of them is visible from inside a single page.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "table", "attrs": {"layout": "default"}, "content": [{"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Problem", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Detail", "type": "text"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Five Test Catalog pages are orphaned", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Map a test to terminology codes (1432059909), Manage label presets (1433468931), Add a test to panels (1433010177), Set test display order (1431666693) and Sample Acceptance Checklist (1435566088) are outside the \ud83d\udcd6 User Manual tree, outside both destination folders, and outside this review area. They are reachable only by direct link. Content looks finished; navigation does not reach it.", "type": "text"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "A published overview links into the review area", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Test Catalog Management \u2014 workflow overview (1437270018) is live under End User Manual, but its \u201cStart here\u201d target (1432453132) is still a draft here. Seven of its thirteen pages are published, one is a draft, five are orphaned \u2014 so the workflow is live with holes in it.", "type": "text"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Duplicate CSV authoring pages", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "1442414603 (draft, July) and 1266122780 (published, April) carry the same title and subject. One must be retired.", "type": "text"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Duplicate patient-registration pages", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "1418166310 and 1440841760 document the same task. Retire the June draft.", "type": "text"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"text": "Published pages that are actively wrong", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "These are worse than a missing page, because a reader follows them and fails. They are live in the manual now, so they need ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "targeted", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"text": " correction rather than rewriting.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "HOW TO IMPORT ANALYZER RESULTS", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1047265314"}}]}, {"text": " \u2014 instructs the reader to click an \u201cImport Analyzer Results\u201d button and upload a file. ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "No such button exists", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"text": " on the analyzer results screen in 3.2.1.11. The real manual-file path is the analyzer bridge's upload form. This is the highest-traffic analyzer task in the product.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Administrator Guide PART 4: Barcode Configuration", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"text": " (256737330), and its Quick Guide twin (452132880) \u2014 both describe the Barcode Configuration screen, which was ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "deleted", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"text": " in 3.2.1.11 and now redirects to Label Presets. They remain the only place preprinted accession numbers and label dimensions are documented at all, so they cannot simply be deleted \u2014 the content has to move.", "type": "text"}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"text": "Areas with no page at all", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "From the implementation task and cadence audit of 5 August 2026, which mapped 100 admin and configuration tasks against 3.2.1.11. Ordered by how often the task recurs, because a daily task with no page generates support load continuously.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "table", "attrs": {"layout": "default"}, "content": [{"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Area", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Cadence", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Note", "type": "text"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Quality control \u2014 Westgard, control lots, Levey-Jennings", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Daily + per control lot", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Eleven tasks, zero pages. The largest single gap in the manual. Note the prerequisite: QC results cannot be entered by hand, so this only applies to electronically integrated instruments.", "type": "text"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Label quantities and printing at order entry", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Every order", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Highest-frequency task in the product and undocumented. Include that the decrease control on the print dialog does not affect snapshot rows.", "type": "text"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Reviewing and accepting analyzer results", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Every run", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Currently served only by the incorrect page above. Cover that the QC failure banner is advisory and does not block acceptance.", "type": "text"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Reprinting labels", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Exception-driven", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Two flows with opposite behaviour: the post-save dialog replays a frozen snapshot, the Barcode page uses live configuration.", "type": "text"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Printed report setup \u2014 logos, director, page numbers", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "One-time", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Two near-identical lab-director fields with different scope; report logos are not the same setting as Site Branding; most settings reach only a subset of templates.", "type": "text"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Analyzer test-code mapping", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Per new assay", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Must be distinguished from Field Mappings, which is a different page doing a different job. Marking a code as mapped does not create the mapping.", "type": "text"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Verifying a reflex rule or calculation", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Every time one is authored", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "There is no preview or dry-run, and saving gives no feedback. A written verification procedure is needed, since the only method is a real order end to end.", "type": "text"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Preprinted accession numbers and label dimensions", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "One-time", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Only documented on the two dead barcode pages. Also: preset dimensions in millimetres act as an aspect ratio only, not a physical size.", "type": "text"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "rule"}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"text": "Rebuilt 5 August 2026 from a live inventory of this page's 39 children, the docs-manual drift report of 1 August 2026, and an implementation task and cadence audit verified against the 3.2.1.11 source tree. Owning epics: ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"text": "OGC-1154", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/browse/OGC-1154"}}, {"type": "em"}]}, {"text": " (Test Catalog and manual-wide style), ", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"text": "OGC-1076", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/browse/OGC-1076"}}, {"type": "em"}]}, {"text": " (Environmental and Vector). The administrator-configuration and end-user clusters, the QC gap and the incorrect published pages had no owner before this rebuild.", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}], "version": 1}